,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T20:43:21Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T20:43:21Z","body":"You really *should* try it on master even if there isn't a related issue. `iced::Color::new` is private, but `iced::Color::from_rgba` is the exact same API-wise.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iced-rs/iced/issues/comments/2887643290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"pml68","id":116908301,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvfhDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116908301?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68","html_url":"https://github.com/pml68","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pml68/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iced-rs/iced/issues/comments/2887700240","html_url":"https://github.com/iced-rs/iced/issues/2946#issuecomment-2887700240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iced-rs/iced/issues/2946","id":2887700240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC784y86sHs8Q","user":{"login":"Atreyagaurav","id":46195892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTk1ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46195892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav","html_url":"https://github.com/Atreyagaurav","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T21:23:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T21:34:54Z","body":"The problem in the code is probably here:\nhttps://github.com/iced-rs/iced/blob/5de7bc83bd213dc417958006ca1b1f92df8530c3/graphics/src/text/editor.rs#L371-L385\n\nSee how the Paste is running different code than the rest. And the [`insert_string`](https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-text/blob/987ff45ff20f3cee1322e2f2909ac4c2c26f8321/src/edit/mod.rs#L315) method doesn't reset the draw cache, [`action`](https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-text/blob/987ff45ff20f3cee1322e2f2909ac4c2c26f8321/src/edit/editor.rs#L562).\n\nThe fix should be as easy as:   [Edit: this doesn't seem to be solve the problem... but doing something here should work..] ,\n```diff\n                    Edit::Paste(text) => {\n                        editor.insert_string(&text, None);\n+                        editor.set_redraw(true);\n                    }\n```\nMaybe more complicated if you want to test things before calling redraw.\n\n\nBut for completeness, I tested it in master, the README seems to be out of date, that's why I couldn't run it following that example.\n\nThis no longer works.\n```\nfn main() -> iced::Result {\n    iced::run(\"A cool counter\", Counter::update, Counter::view)\n}\n```\nBecause of this: https://github.com/iced-rs/iced/blob/5de7bc83bd213dc417958006ca1b1f92df8530c3/src/lib.rs#L693-L697\n\n\nAnyway, here is the code for master:\n\n```toml\n[package]\nname = \"ice-issue\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2024\"\n\n[dependencies]\niced = { git = \"https://github.com/iced-rs/iced.git\" , features = [\"highlighter\"] }\niced_core = {git = \"https://github.com/iced-rs/iced.git\"}\n```\n\n```rust\nuse core::ops::Range;\nuse iced::widget::text_editor;\nuse iced::Color;\nuse iced::{Element, Fill, Font};\nuse iced_core::text::highlighter::{Format, Highlighter};\n\nfn main() -> iced::Result {\n    iced::run(Editor::update, Editor::view)\n}\n\n#[derive(Default)]\nstruct Editor {\n    content: text_editor::Content,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\nenum Message {\n    Editor(text_editor::Action),\n}\n\nimpl Editor {\n    fn update(&mut self, message: Message) {\n        match message {\n            Message::Editor(a) => self.content.perform(a),\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn view(&self) -> Element<'_, Message> {\n        text_editor(&self.content)\n            .height(Fill)\n            .on_action(Message::Editor)\n            .font(Font::MONOSPACE)\n            .highlight_with::<MyHighlighter>((), Highlight::to_format)\n            .into()\n    }\n}\n\nenum Highlight {\n    First,\n    Second,\n    None,\n}\n\nimpl Highlight {\n    fn get(i: usize) -> Self {\n        match i {\n            0 => Self::First,\n            1 => Self::Second,\n            _ => Self::None,\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn to_format(&self, _theme: &iced::Theme) -> Format<Font> {\n        let color = match self {\n            Self::First => Some(Color::from_rgb(0.0, 0.0, 0.1)),\n            Self::Second => Some(Color::from_rgb(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)),\n            Self::None => None,\n        };\n        Format { color, font: None }\n    }\n}\n\nfn highlight_line(line: &str) -> Vec<(Range<usize>, Highlight)> {\n    let mut offset = 0;\n    line.split(\" \")\n        .enumerate()\n        .map(|(i, l)| {\n            let start = offset;\n            offset += l.len() + 1;\n            (start..offset, Highlight::get(i))\n        })\n        .collect()\n}\n\nstruct MyHighlighter {\n    curr_line: usize,\n}\n\nimpl Highlighter for MyHighlighter {\n    type Settings = ();\n    type Highlight = Highlight;\n    type Iterator<'a> = Box<dyn Iterator<Item = (Range<usize>, Self::Highlight)>>;\n    fn new(_: &Self::Settings) -> Self {\n        Self { curr_line: 0 }\n    }\n    fn update(&mut self, _: &Self::Settings) {\n        self.change_line(0);\n    }\n\n    fn change_line(&mut self, line: usize) {\n        self.curr_line = line;\n    }\n    fn highlight_line(&mut self, line: &str) -> Self::Iterator<'_> {\n        Box::new(highlight_line(line).into_iter())\n    }\n    fn current_line(&self) -> usize {\n        self.curr_line\n    }\n}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iced-rs/iced/issues/comments/2887700240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Atreyagaurav","id":46195892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTk1ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46195892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav","html_url":"https://github.com/Atreyagaurav","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Atreyagaurav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gi